Topic pages for the builtin list, the flag table, the diagnostic
codes, and the mismatch dial.
.TP
.B jqf --help generators, --help facts, --help diff
Topic pages for the engine-namespace generators, node/value facts
and markup attributes, and the --diff lane.
.TP
.B jqf --help-format \fIformat\fR
One focused page per input/output format and its dialects.
.TP
.B jqf --list-formats, --list-builtins
Machine-readable enumerations of the format table and the builtin registry.
